Twelve source files are copied from Axon Framework, from the main branch at
5.2.0-SNAPSHOT, commit 22a9fd3f6a9c943f602c6ede55b40690b26c6210 (2026-04-07).
They are the distributed command bus and distributed query bus that Axon
Framework shipped in axon-messaging before version 5.1, together with the
CommandBusConnector and QueryBusConnector contracts they are built on. Later
Axon Framework releases moved them out of the open-source artifacts, and this
connector needs them to plug KronosDB in as the command and query transport.

They live in src/main/java/io/kronosdb/connector/axon/distributed/ and keep
their original license headers. Each file starts with a comment naming the file
it came from and its original package. The only modification is the package
declaration, which is now:

  io.kronosdb.connector.axon.distributed.command
  io.kronosdb.connector.axon.distributed.query

Original packages and files:

  org.axonframework.messaging.commandhandling.distributed
    CommandBusConnector
    DelegatingCommandBusConnector
    DistributedCommandBus
    DistributedCommandBusConfiguration
    DistributedCommandBusConfigurationEnhancer
    PayloadConvertingCommandBusConnector

  org.axonframework.messaging.queryhandling.distributed
    QueryBusConnector
    DelegatingQueryBusConnector
    DistributedQueryBus
    DistributedQueryBusConfiguration
    DistributedQueryBusConfigurationEnhancer
    PayloadConvertingQueryBusConnector

Axon Framework does not ship a NOTICE file (none exists in its source tree at
that commit or in the released axon-messaging jars), so there is no Axon
Framework NOTICE content to reproduce here.

